        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an expert insurance consultant writing a personalized renewal reminder to {{ $json.Full_Name }}.\n\nPolicy Details:\n\nClient Name: {{ $json.Full_Name }}\n\nPolicy Type: {{ $json.Policy_Type }}\n\nExpiration Date: {{ $json.Expiration_Date }}\n\nInstructions: > 1. Remind them politely that their policy expires in {{$json.days_to_expiration }} days.\n\nAsk if they want to renew as-is or explore upgraded coverage options.\n\nProvide this link to view plans and features: https://yourbrokerage.com/plans\n\nKeep the email concise (under 120 words), warm, and professional.\n\nOutput ONLY the email body text without conversational intro/outro wrappers.\n\nSTRICT OUTPUT RULES:\n1. Output ONLY pure raw HTML string.\n2. DO NOT use Markdown formatting (Do NOT wrap in ```html or ```).\n3. DO NOT include any signatures, footers, disclaimers, or mentions of automation/AI/n8n.\n4. Replace [DYNAMIC_EMAIL_BODY] in the HTML template below with a concise (under 100 words), professional, and personalized message reminding {{ $json.Full_Name }} that their {{ $json.Policy_Type }} policy expires in {{ $json.days_to_expiration }} days. Ask if they want to renew as-is or explore upgraded coverage.\n\nHTML TEMPLATE TO POPULATE:\n<div style=\"background-color: #f8fafc; padding: 30px 10px; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\">\n    \n    <div style=\"background-color: #0f172a; padding: 24px 32px; text-align: left;\">\n      <h1 style=\"color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">POLICY RENEWAL NOTICE</h1>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"padding: 32px; color: #334155; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;\">\n      <p style=\"margin-top: 0; font-weight: 600; color: #0f172a;\">Dear {{ $json.Full_Name }},</p>\n\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n        [DYNAMIC_EMAIL_BODY]\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"background-color: #f1f5f9; border-left: 4px solid #2563eb; padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: 4px; margin: 24px 0;\">\n        <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: #64748b;\">Policy Type:</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: #0f172a; font-weight: 600; text-align: right;\">{{ $json.Policy_Type }}</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: #64748b;\">Expiration Date:</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: #0f172a; font-weight: 600; text-align: right;\">{{ $json.Expiration_Date }}</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: #64748b;\">Days Remaining:</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 6px 0; color: #dc2626; font-weight: 600; text-align: right;\">{{ $json.days_to_expiration }} Days</td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 32px 0 16px 0;\">\n        <a href=\"https://yourbrokerage.com/plans\" style=\"background-color: #2563eb; color: #ffffff; padding: 14px 28px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; display: inline-block;\">Review & Renew Coverage</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"background-color: #f8fafc; padding: 20px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8;\">\n      <p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-weight: 600; color: #64748b;\">Prime Insurance Services</p>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0;\">Reply directly to this email to speak with your assigned advisor.</p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>"
            }
